    "body": "## Problem\n\nCI downloads the Perl and Ruby providers on every run, leaving interpreter setup exposed to transient download failures such as [this failed job](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/actions/runs/36114355612/job/108004821890).\n\n## Solution\n\nInstall Perl modules, Ruby gems, and the Ruby host executable under `.deps` so the existing dependency cache preserves them. Set the provider load paths for the job and reuse installed versions without registry lookups. The existing setup action adds the cached Ruby host directory to `PATH`.\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-25T11:27:14Z",
